# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# PT Lingo — Commit Message
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Format: <type>: <description>
# Types: Step | Fix | Feature | Polish | Refactor | Docs | Chore
#
# Examples:
#   Step 42: Nostr onboarding flow — Path A/B/C/D
#   Fix: quarantined filter missing from review queue fetch
#   Feature: PathStatsPanel desktop right column
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# CLAUDE.md: updated / not needed / TODO
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# If updated, confirm:
#   [ ] Completed steps table reflects this change
#   [ ] Current State section is accurate
#   [ ] New architectural decisions documented
#   [ ] New bug patterns / fixes captured
#   [ ] Next available step updated
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
